@meeting endingTell.change.go
// SW6 (ending writer A), changing your mind: you'd said Stay (or Not sure), now Go, any time before the address. Short.
title: The Captain
from: Captain Odile Marrow
gist: You changed your mind and told the Captain you're taking the post at headquarters.
== lines
marrow: You've come about the letter again. I wondered if you might.   [listen]
marrow > you: Going, then. That's allowed. It's what Sunday's for.   [nod]
marrow: Be sure. After Sunday the ship knows, and after Monday the Tern's gone. Thank you for telling me first.
